    "MSVC and static CRT: hosted image inventory and Microsoft servicing; no complete automatic package mapping.",
    ".NET host, Windows PowerShell 5.1, Windows OS and browser servicing: platform inventory, not a cataloged portable package closure.",
    "QEMU/KVM, Bash, Git, tar and host libraries: host distribution servicing; not covered by the application Cargo advisory audit.",
    "Mend-hosted Renovate runtime and its dependencies are serviced by the vendor. Local checks consume only the pinned official configuration schema; the Renovate npm dependency graph is not executed.",
    "The Actions Python binary distribution and system shared libraries require vendor/distribution servicing; Python language advisories are checked by exact upstream version and commit."
  ]
